{"product_id":"al-fakher-nic-salt-blueberry-gum","title":"Al Fakher Nic Salt Blueberry Gum","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover the latest addition to the Al Fakher Nicotine Salt Family. Crafted with precision and care, these salts offer a smooth and satisfying vaping experience. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhether you crave fruity sweetness or refreshing menthol. Elevate your vaping experience with Al Fakher Nicotine Salt e-liquids and enjoy vaping like never before.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlueberry Gum: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis delightful flavor combines the sweetness of ripe blueberries with the familiar chewiness of bubblegum, that's both fruity and fun. Each puff is like a trip down memory lane, with the juicy blueberry flavor bringing back fond childhood memories of blowing bubbles and chewing gum.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable in 20mg and 50mg\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChubby unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Al Fakher","offers":[{"title":"20MG","offer_id":41700837720119,"sku":"69d25f740d238","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41700837752887,"sku":"69d25f7498a5c","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/al-fakher-nicotine-salt-eliquid-blueberry-gum-min.jpg?v=1749515275","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/al-fakher-nic-salt-blueberry-gum","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




